      "value": "@{5e877e5e60de627e6ba7946a|full_name} This problem is still in game and not fixed or back as of 1784. You guys fixed one thing and broke another but not sure anymore. Whatever you guys did with the resting colliders update it seems to have done something to marshmellow pb on my avatar making my models breasts jitter when moving or made it worse if it was present or not. No idea what is happening because i never noticed this until the update other day. Something is broken. This seems to be a client side issue, i cannot see the problem on my friend using one of my models or in a mirror. like i type in my post OBS cannot pick up the jitter in a recording. You guys need to test this on your end. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1784-some-physbone-setups-are-now-jittering-locally-while-moving-after-update",
